{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日，據多位用户在社交媒體上反饋，在更新DeepSeek移動端應用或使用網頁版時，對話界面出現了一項此前未曾有過的變化：每輪問答結束後，系統會生成一張詳情卡片，清晰列出本次交互所消耗的Token數量及對應金額估算。由於卡片上明確標註了具體資費，部分用户將其解讀為DeepSeek即將啓動收費的信號。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588216.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T12:24:15.471109+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T12:03:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T12:17:22.626534+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:17:22.626534+00:00","content_hash":"ab850ca0d9d02c60e54088c019704991ab0dee98904c5a65a047b1fd0c9d7add","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}